## Notes on Source Quality

The source includes a Hermes skill mapping section that conflates de Bono's thinking framework with productivity optimization tools (habit tracking, time blocking, Eisenhower Matrix). This mapping appears to be an ingestion artifact and does not reflect the core methodology of Six Thinking Hats, which is about perspective diversity in thinking rather than personal productivity systems.
